31/Mar/26 9:39 AM;ereyburn;For Cyber_806 [SI-07-05], The PHC shall generate an alert when integrity violations are discovered. The control SI-07-05 says to select one action; the action selected for the requirement is:  implement [Assignment: organization-defined controls]] when integrity violations are discovered

The org-defined control is to generate an alert. This makes the requirement redundant to CYBER_805 [SI-07-02]. 

The first step in addressing this backlog item is to delete CYBER_806 and trace CYBER_805 to NIST control SI-07-05 in addition to SI-07-02.;;;

